le":"进军退还","evidence":["zhuge-e-o036a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":229,"label":"建兴七年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhuge-y229","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhuge-q-o036","basis":"建兴七年"},"evidence":["zhuge-e-o036a-q","zhuge-q-o036","zhuge-q-b-2cd6c12d0155d7b41caf"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhuge-e-o036a-q","source_order":[35,218,"O036a"],"order":6792}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0120","name":"陈式","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o068","zhangle-q-o043","zhuge-q-o036"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xianzhu-m-o068-xianzhu-p0120","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o068"]},{"id":"zhangle-m-o043-xianzhu-p0120","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o043"]},{"id":"zhuge-m-o036-xianzhu-p0120","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-o036"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houzhu-q-O019","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-1d00334bb899d9e8167d","layer":"original","quote":"七年春，亮遣陈式攻武都、阴平，遂克定二郡。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o068a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-8136daaf302c35b9c188","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖7〗，先主军还秭归；将军吴班、陈式水军屯夷陵，夹江东西岸〖8〗。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-e2b85eacbc16310809ee","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-e2b85eacbc16310809ee","layer":"modern","quote":"〖7〗二年：章武二年（公元 222）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":413,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-18295fa1c5ff11c612db","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o068","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-8136daaf302c35b9c188","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖7〗，先主军还秭归；将军吴班、陈式水军屯夷陵，夹江东西岸〖8〗。二月，先主自秭归率诸将进军，缘山截岭，于夷道猇亭﹝二﹞驻营〖9〗。自佷山﹝三﹞通武陵〖10〗，遣侍中马良安慰五溪蛮夷〖11〗，咸相率响应。镇北将军黄权督江北诸军，与吴军相拒于夷陵道。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o043a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-dbb7d283a8944f0b7f42","layer":"original","quote":"太祖还邺，留晃与夏侯渊拒刘备于阳平。备遣陈式等十余营，绝马鸣阁道〖15〗；晃别征，破之。贼自投山谷，多死者。太祖闻，甚喜，假晃节。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o043","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-dbb7d283a8944f0b7f42","layer":"original","quote":"太祖还邺，留晃与夏侯渊拒刘备于阳平。备遣陈式等十余营，绝马鸣阁道〖15〗；晃别征，破之。贼自投山谷，多死者。太祖闻，甚喜，假晃节。令曰：“此阁道，汉中之险要咽喉也。刘备欲断绝外内，以取汉中。将军一举，克夺贼计，善之善者也！”太祖遂自至阳平，引出汉中诸军。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":148,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":127,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o036a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-019120a2568f2b0d74c9","layer":"original","quote":"七年〖21〗，亮遣陈式攻武都、阴平。魏雍州刺史郭淮率众欲击式，亮自出至建威〖22〗；淮退还，遂平二郡。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-2cd6c12d0155d7b41caf","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-2cd6c12d0155d7b41caf","layer":"modern","quote":"〖21〗七年：建兴七年（公元 229）。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":240,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6aef03116ccf2e720e54","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o036","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-019120a2568f2b0d74c9","layer":"original","quote":"七年〖21〗，亮遣陈式攻武都、阴平。魏雍州刺史郭淮率众欲击式，亮自出至建威〖22〗；淮退还，遂平二郡。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":217,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
